  {
   "id": "n139",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 218.66,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 984,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1810,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1) Valeria arma la version de\n   la semana en el CMS.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1) Valeria arma la version de\n   la semana en el CMS.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n140",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 233.74,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 991,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1823,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2) Se firma el manifiesto y se\n   saca el hash de cada bloque.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2) Se firma el manifiesto y se\n   saca el hash de cada bloque.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n141",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1430,
   "y": 928,
   "width": 248.82,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 998,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1836,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3) Los archivos quedan en HTTPS\n   y se pueden pedir por pedazos.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3) Los archivos quedan en HTTPS\n   y se pueden pedir por pedazos.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n142",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1690,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 263.9,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1005,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1849,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4) La red es poca y se corta:\n   nunca se pide el paquete entero.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "4) La red es poca y se corta:\n   nunca se pide el paquete entero.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n143",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1970,
   "y": 920,
   "width": 286.52,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1012,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1862,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5) El Sync Agent compara manifiestos\n   y baja solo lo que cambio (300 MB).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "5) El Sync Agent compara manifiestos\n   y baja solo lo que cambio (300 MB).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n144",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 905,
   "width": 271.44,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1019,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1875,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "9) Rosa y Diego trabajan contra\n   el nodo, con la WAN desconectada.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "9) Rosa y Diego trabajan contra\n   el nodo, con la WAN desconectada.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n145",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2075,
   "y": 1090,
   "width": 104.4,
   "height": 30.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1026,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1888,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "6) Si se corta,\n   queda PAUSED",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "6) Si se corta,\n   queda PAUSED",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n146",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1965,
   "y": 1285,
   "width": 248.82,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1033,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1901,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "6b) al volver, pide solo el rango\n    pendiente: no reinicia nada.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "6b) al volver, pide solo el rango\n    pendiente: no reinicia nada.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n147",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2245,
   "y": 1468,
   "width": 422.24,
   "height": 48.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
